    dct:description "Ingested 27 source files into 32 assets under https://www.insperity.com/, with IRIs, labels and metadata brought into line with Semantic Governance: Services, Architecture & Integration v1.8 (Draft), Part III. Every asset is at version 0.1.0, Draft. Results: Application business taxonomy taxonomy (646 terms, 10 conformance errors, 3 warnings); Application business taxonomy shapes (35 terms, 0 conformance errors, 35 warnings); Application data domain taxonomy (223 terms, 2 conformance errors, 1 warning); Core party taxonomy (44 terms, 4 conformance errors, 1 warning); Core party shapes (7 terms, 0 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core businessoperations taxonomy (76 terms, 1 conformance error, 1 warning); Core compliance taxonomy (115 terms, 3 conformance errors, 11 warnings); Core compliance shapes (2 terms, 0 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Reference domain taxonomy (23 terms, 0 conformance errors, 1 warning); Reference domain shapes (20 terms, 0 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core issue taxonomy (42 terms, 38 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core lifecycle taxonomy (24 terms, 23 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core location taxonomy (26 terms, 21 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core persona taxonomy (46 terms, 0 conformance errors, 1 warning); Core process taxonomy (29 terms, 25 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core product taxonomy (69 terms, 1 conformance error, 1 warning); Core product shapes (12 terms, 0 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core role taxonomy (43 terms, 38 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core rules taxonomy (29 terms, 27 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core services taxonomy (98 terms, 1 conformance error, 1 warning); Core services technicalservices taxonomy (390 terms, 3 conformance errors, 1 warning); Core time taxonomy (30 terms, 24 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core asset taxonomy (51 terms, 39 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core capability taxonomy (28 terms, 17 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core decision taxonomy (19 terms, 18 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core event taxonomy (50 terms, 47 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core governance taxonomy (39 terms, 33 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core logic taxonomy (33 terms, 30 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core measure taxonomy (53 terms, 53 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core policy taxonomy (33 terms, 30 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core requirements taxonomy (31 terms, 30 conformance errors, 0 warnings); Core value taxonomy (28 terms, 24 conformance errors, 0 warnings). 12 files were skipped: Taxonomy_Core_Party_1.0.ttl, taxonomy-core-party.ttl, Taxonomy_Core_Issue_1.0.ttl, Taxonomy_Core_Lifecycle_1.0.ttl, Taxonomy_Core_Location_1.0.ttl, taxonomy-core-persona.ttl, Taxonomy_Core_Process_1.0.ttl, taxonomy-core-product.ttl, Taxonomy_Core_Role_1.0.ttl, Taxonomy_Core_Rules_1.0.ttl, taxonomy-core-service.ttl, Taxonomy_Core_Time_1.0.ttl."@en ;
